msgid ""
"A crash report contains a snapshot of Avogadro's memory at the moment it "
"failed, along with your operating system, graphics driver and Avogadro "
"version, and a log of recent activity. That memory snapshot makes the report"
" useful, but it may incidentally include fragments of what you were working "
"on, such as part of a file name or a molecule you had open."
msgstr ""
"En kraschrapport innehåller en ögonblicksbild av Avogadros minne när "
"programmet slutade fungera, operativsystemet, grafikdrivrutinen och "
"Avogadro-versionen samt en logg över nylig aktivitet. Minnesbilden gör "
"rapporten användbar men kan av misstag innehålla delar av det du arbetade "
"med, exempelvis en del av ett filnamn eller en molekyl som var öppen."

