msgstr "Antal k-punkter som förbinder särskilda k-punkter:"

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid "Special k-points"
msgstr "Särskilda k-punkter"

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid "Max y: "
msgstr "Max. y: "

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid "<html><head/><body><p>The Fermi Level</p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>Ferminivån</p></body></html>"

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Enter special k-points as such:</p><p>L 0.5 0.5 "
"0.5</p><p>G 0.0 0.0 0.0</p><p>X 0.5 0.0 0.5</p><p>That is, &lt;symbol&gt; "
"&lt;x&gt; &lt;y&gt; &lt;z&gt; where x, y, and z are fractional reciprocal "
"space coordinates. Lines will be drawn connecting these k-points on the "
"graph in the order you put them in. Please note that the orientation of your"
" cell may have an effect on the locations of these reciprocal space "
"points.</p><p>If the space group of the crystal has been perceived or set, "
"the special k points will be automatically filled up with the primitive cell"
" high symmetry points for that space group. There are a few space groups "
"will different high symmetry points depending on the lattice (such as if a "
"&gt; b or a &lt; b) - that is taken into account "
"automatically.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Ange särskilda k-punkter så här:</p><p>L 0.5 0.5 "
"0.5</p><p>G 0.0 0.0 0.0</p><p>X 0.5 0.0 0.5</p><p>Alltså &lt;symbol&gt; "
"&lt;x&gt; &lt;y&gt; &lt;z&gt;, där x, y och z är fraktionella koordinater i "
"det reciproka rummet. Linjer ritas mellan dessa k-punkter i diagrammet i den"
" ordning du anger dem. Observera att cellens orientering kan påverka "
"positionerna för dessa reciproka rums-punkter.</p><p>Om kristallens "
"rymdgrupp har fastställts eller angetts fylls de särskilda k-punkterna "
"automatiskt med den primitiva cellens högsymmetripunkter för den "
"rymdgruppen. Några rymdgrupper har olika högsymmetripunkter beroende på "
"gittret (till exempel om a &gt; b eller a &lt; b) – detta tas automatiskt "
"med i beräkningen.</p></body></html>"

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid ""
"<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n"
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-family:'Ubuntu'; font-size:11pt;\">GM 0.0 0.0 0.0</span></p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n"
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-family:'Ubuntu'; font-size:11pt;\">GM 0.0 0.0 0.0</span></p></body></html>"

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Enter the number of k-points that will be connecting "
"the special k-points. More of these k-points will smooth out the graph, but "
"the calculation may take longer.</p><p>Default: 40</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Ange antalet k-punkter som ska förbinda de särskilda "
"k-punkterna. Fler sådana k-punkter gör diagrammet jämnare, men beräkningen "
"kan ta längre tid.</p><p>Standard: 40</p></body></html>"

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Limit the y-range in the plot?</p><p>Default: "
"off</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Begränsa y-intervallet i diagrammet?</p><p>Standard: "
"av</p></body></html>"

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid "Limit y-range?"
msgstr "Begränsa y-intervallet?"

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>The number of periodic "
"dimensions.</p><p><br/></p><p>If this is set to 1, the material will be "
"periodic only along the A vector of the crystal.</p><p><br/></p><p>If this "
"is set to 2, the material will be periodic along both the A and B vectors of"
" the crystal.</p><p><br/></p><p>If this is set to 3, the material will be "
"periodic along the A, B, and C vectors of the "
"crystal.</p><p><br/></p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Antalet periodiska dimensioner.</p><p><br/></p><p>Om "
"detta är inställt på 1 är materialet endast periodiskt längs kristallens "
"A-vektor.</p><p><br/></p><p>Om detta är inställt på 2 är materialet "
"periodiskt längs både kristallens A- och B-vektorer.</p><p><br/></p><p>Om "
"detta är inställt på 3 är materialet periodiskt längs kristallens A-, B- och"
" C-vektorer.</p><p><br/></p></body></html>"

