#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid ""
"If there are two notes at the cursor height this command swaps them round. "
"This affects which note will be acted on by commands such as fingering, "
"string-number, sharpen, flatten etc."
msgstr ""
"Om det finns två noter i markörens höjd byter detta kommando om dem. Detta "
"påverkar vilken not som kommer att påverkas av kommandon som fingersättning,"
" strängnummer, skärpa, flata etc."

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid "Arpeggiate"
msgstr "Arpeggiate"

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid "Transforms the three-note chord at the cursor into a triplet of notes."
msgstr ""
"Omvandlar det tretoniga ackordet vid markören till en trippel av toner."

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid ""
"This directive places a sequence of bass note names after the next chord. "
"You can delete it with the usual backspace and del commands."
msgstr ""
"Detta direktiv placerar en sekvens av basnotnamn efter nästa ackord. Du kan "
"ta bort det med de vanliga kommandona backspace och del."

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid "Give Next Note or Blank to finish"
msgstr "Ge Next Note eller Blank för att avsluta"

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid "Place the cursor on chord to which bass sequence belongs"
msgstr "Placera markören på det ackord som bassekvensen hör till"

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid "Bass Sequence"
msgstr "Bas-sekvens"

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid "Typesets a sequence of bass inversion notes."
msgstr "Skriver en sekvens med basinversionsnoter."

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid "Change Enharmonic Down"
msgstr "Förändring Enharmonic Down"

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid ""
"Switch through enharmonic variants of the same sounding note in the "
"direction of lower diatonic base notes"
msgstr ""
"Växla mellan enharmoniska varianter av samma klingande not i riktning mot "
"lägre diatoniska basnoter"

#. from yeager:weblate-review
