msgstr ""
"Skifta genom enharmoniska varianter av samma klingande not i riktning mot "
"högre diatoniska grundtoner."

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid "Change chord-member to whole note"
msgstr "Ändra ackordmedlem till hel not"

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid ""
"Change one chord member to appear like a whole-note duration without "
"changing the original logic like measure calculation or the duration of "
"newly added chord members."
msgstr ""
"Ändra en ackorddel så att den ser ut som en hel notduration utan att ändra "
"den ursprungliga logiken, t.ex. taktberäkning eller durationen för "
"nytillagda ackorddelar."

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid "Change chord-member to half note"
msgstr "Ändra ackordmedlem till halvton"

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid ""
"Change one chord member to appear like a half-note duration without changing"
