msgid ""
"Instructs LilyPond engraver to stop previously started manual beaming. Print"
" effect only."
msgstr ""
"Instruerar LilyPond-graveringsmaskinen att stoppa tidigare påbörjad manuell "
"strålning. Endast utskriftseffekt."

#. from yeager:weblate-review
