"Doubles the duration of the note/chord/rest at the cursor or the selection. "
"E.g. Quarter Note becomes Half Note."
msgstr ""
"Fördubblar längden på noten/ackordet/vilan vid markören eller markeringen. "
"T.ex. kvartsnot blir halvnot."

#. from yeager:weblate-review
