msgid "ChoirStaff Start"
msgstr "KörStaff Start"

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid ""
"Start grouping single staves together in order to form multi-stave systems. "
"In a ChoirStaff, the group starts with a bracket, but bar lines are not "
"connected."
msgstr ""
"Börja gruppera ihop enstaka notsystem för att bilda flerstaviga system. I en"
" ChoirStaff börjar gruppen med en parentes, men taktstrecken är inte "
"sammankopplade."

