"Prints this staff (only) transposed. This is in addition to any score-wide "
"transposition"
msgstr ""
"Skriver ut detta notblad (endast) transponerat. Detta är utöver eventuell "
"transposition över hela partituret"

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid "Un-dot Rests"
msgstr "Un-dot pauser"

