msgstr ""
"Obs! Den här inställningen gäller endast lokala tjänster på enheten (inte "
"vidarebefordran)."

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid ""
"Note: you may also need a DHCP Proxy (currently unavailable) when specifying"
