"Disables interlacing offset which may reduce blurring in some situations."
msgstr ""
"Inaktiverar sammanflätningsförskjutning, vilket kan minska oskärpa i vissa "
"situationer."

#. from yeager:weblate-review
msgid "Calendar year for the virtual PS2 RTC."
msgstr "Kalenderår för den virtuella PS2:ans RTC."

#. from yeager:weblate-review
